infographic hierarchy-mindmap-level-gradient-compact-card
data
  title One YAML pipeline, three pluggable stages
  desc Compose each stage from a menu — change routing, redaction, or sampling by editing YAML, not application code
  root
    label OTel Collector pipeline
    children
      - label Receivers — accept telemetry
        desc otlp (gRPC 4317 / HTTP 4318), filelog, prometheus, kafka — normalise every source to OTLP
      - label Processors — transform in-flight (ordered)
        desc memory_limiter (drop before OOM, runs first), batch, k8sattributes (add pod/namespace/node), attributes (redact PII), tail_sampling
      - label Exporters — ship to backends
        desc otlp to Tempo/Jaeger, prometheusremotewrite to Mimir, loki for logs, datadog and other vendors
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
